flowchart TD
    Start[Operator starts migration or closure] --> Auth{Platform authorization?}
    Auth -- no --> Deny[Reject and audit]
    Auth -- yes --> Plan[Create run or closure request]
    Plan --> Preflight[Check status, locks, backup evidence, and dependencies]
    Preflight --> Safe{Preflight safe?}
    Safe -- no --> Block[Block with actionable findings]
    Safe -- yes --> Canary[Run canary or retention phase]
    Canary --> Review{Review result and evidence}
    Review -- pause --> Paused[Pause run / retain tenant]
    Review -- continue --> Batch[Process bounded batches]
    Batch --> Verify[Verify schema/data/resource invariants]
    Verify --> More{More batches?}
    More -- yes --> Batch
    More -- no --> Finalize[Finalize migration or destruction window]
    Finalize --> Audit[Persist operator, tenant, timestamps, result]
    Audit --> Complete[Complete and expose evidence]
    Block --> Audit
    Paused --> Audit

    Note1[Destructive closure requires disposable-tenant testing and verified recovery evidence.] -.-> Preflight
    Note2[No browser-selected tenant database or unbounded bulk action.] -.-> Batch